==English==

===Pronunciation===
*{{AHD|bôlʹsəm}}, {{IPA|/ˈbɔːlsəm/}}, {{SAMPA|/"bO:ls@m/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# A sweet-smelling [[oil]] or [[resin]] derived from various plants.
# A [[soothing]] [[ointment]].
# A [[flower]] of the genus ''[[Impatiens]]''.

